### CRUD concret : Camping des Calanques
POST http://localhost/parcNational/backend/api/camping.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Camping des Calanques",
  "localisation": "Calanque de Sormiou",
  "capacite": 50
}

### Vérification de la liste des campings (GET)
GET http://localhost/parcNational/backend/api/camping.php

### Lecture d'un camping précis (GET)
GET http://localhost/parcNational/backend/api/camping.php?id=1

### Modification du camping (PUT)
PUT http://localhost/parcNational/backend/api/camping.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "nom": "Camping des Calanques - Modifié",
  "localisation": "Calanque de Morgiou",
  "capacite": 60
}

### Suppression du camping (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost/parcNational/backend/api/camping.php?id=1

